<title>USA: KinderCare completes exchange offer.</title>
<headline>KinderCare completes exchange offer.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>KinderCare Learning Centers Inc said Wednesday that as of 1700 EDT/2100 GMT, May 13, all of its $300 milion 9-1/2 percent senior subordinated notes due 2009 had been tendered under its previously announced exchange offer.</p>
<p>It said the date of acceptance for exchange of the notes will be May 14.</p>
